    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynasty crumbles. The land fractures. You're one of many orphans, taken in by distant kin. On reaching adulthood, you become a constable, whether for survival or ambition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Long Knives</strong></i> is a low-fantasy wuxia text-based adventure with TTRPG mechanics and deep narrative branching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TTRPG-inspired. Second-person narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize attributes. Choose pre-orphan background. Allocate points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proficiencies affect skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses an 18-sided die, not D20.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visible and hidden checks. Reload anytime.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalized Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every line of dialogue is your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story branches respond to hidden variables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cloud saves. All data is local.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynasty crumbles. The land fractures. You're one of many orphans, taken in by distant kin. On reaching adulthood, you become a constable, whether for survival or ambition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Long Knives</strong></i> is a low-fantasy wuxia text-based adventure with TTRPG mechanics and deep narrative branching.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TTRPG-inspired. Second-person narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize attributes. Choose pre-orphan background. Allocate points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proficiencies affect skill checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uses an 18-sided die, not D20.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visible and hidden checks. Reload anytime.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Personalized Experience</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every line of dialogue is your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story branches respond to hidden variables.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cloud saves. All data is local.</p></li></ul>",
